		"description": "<p>Your Combat Dice are now d8s. You gain an additional pool of INT uses of Coordinated Strike to use per Safe Rest (you may use Coordinated Strike only 1/round). Attacks made from your Coordinated Strikes also now ignore disadvantage.</p><hr><p>Level 9: Your Combat Dice are now d10s. +1 use of Coordinated Strike.</p><p>Level 13: Your Combat Dice are now d12s. +1 use of Coordinated Strike.</p><p>Level 17: Your Combat Dice are now d20s. +1 use of Coordinated Strike.</p><p><em>[A] The die sizes and the extra uses are automated; the uses pool appears on Coordinated Strike!. [M] Ignoring disadvantage on the Coordinated Strike attacks is up to you.</em></p>",
